.TH MOXY-VERSION 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy-version \- Print moxy build version and any build-time-pinned tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy version
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the moxy version+commit burnt in via -ldflags at build time, plus a row for each external tool that was pinned alongside (currently: madder). Mirrors `spinclass version` so the audit trail is consistent.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy (1)
